Source() -> 0:a::Bypass():0 -> Sink()
Source() -> 1:a:1 -> Sink()

Source() -> b::Bypass():0 -> Sink()
b:1 -> Sink()

c::Bypass() -> Sink()
Source() -> 1:c:1 -> Sink()

src0::Source() -> rr::RoundRobin(gates=[0, 1])
rr:0 -> 0:d::Bypass():0 -> dst::Sink()
rr:1 -> 1:d:1 -> dst
src1::Source() -> 0:d
